Licensing of this repository
============================

This repository is a GitHub fork of danhper/defi-plf-analysis. Its files fall
into three groups, and each group is covered by different terms.

1. Files written by the original authors
   (everything inherited from danhper/defi-plf-analysis, listed in README.md
   under "What is where" as "Authors")
   The original repository has no licence. These files are included only as
   part of a GitHub fork, under GitHub's Terms of Service (section D.5).
   Nothing in this file grants any licence to them.

2. Files written for this replication (listed in README.md as "This project")

   a. Code (all files in scripts/)
      are licensed under the MIT License:

